    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5005002030480,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "地上波ゴールデンの音楽番組よ？\r\n受けない理由ないでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500500203/5005002030480"
  },
  {
    "id": 5005002030490,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆのことを全然知らない人も観るくらいの規模だし……\r\n出なかったら、ファンを増やすチャンスもなくなるっての",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500500203/5005002030490"
  },
  {
    "id": 5005002030500,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたが何を心配してるのか、\r\nふゆにはぜんっぜんわかんないんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500500203/5005002030500"
  },
  {
    "id": 5005002030510,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……惨めになるから出ないなんて……\r\nもっと惨めな気持ちになるじゃない",
